<title>USA: Nuevo bolstered by share buyback.</title>
<headline>Nuevo bolstered by share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Nuevo Energy Co rose $1-5/8 to $44-5/8 by 1430 EST after the company announced it would repurchase up to one million shares.</p>
<p>&quot;The repurchase of one million shares would represent 5 percent of total shares outstanding of 20.1 million as of March 5, 1997,&quot; Nuevo President and Chief Executive Officer Mike Watford said in a statement.</p>
<p>Nuevo will fund the buyback through free cash flow and sale of marginal assets and without resorting to debt or reducing its capital spending. ((-- David Chance New York Newsroom 212 859 1902))</p>
</text>
